```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization deletion request --help
Request organization deletion

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization deletion request [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --yes                  Confirm the 30-day deletion schedule
      --json                 Print the deletion result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

Authorization:
  Only a current active human owner can request organization deletion.

Account access:
  A confirmed organization request leaves the local human credential unchanged.

```
